OL,3,GNEWSAGrand Theft Auto staff sacked as
OL,4,A'shock tactic' to punish trade union
OL,5,Aactivity, tribunal hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe dismissal of 34 workers from
OL,8,FRockstar North were the tactics of
OL,9,F"shock and awe" designed to punish
OL,10,Ftrade union activity, an employment
OL,11,Ftribunal has heard.
OL,13,FThe claim was made during closing
OL,14,Fsubmissions in a case brought by 23
OL,15,Fformer employees who said they were
OL,16,Fsacked for trying to unionise.
OL,18,FThe gaming giant behind Grand Theft
OL,19,FAuto, said it took action after staff
OL,20,Fdiscussed confidential information,
OL,21,Fincluding specific game features, on a
OL,22,FDiscord channel that was not private.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
