OL,3,GNEWSAGrand Theft Auto staff sacked as
OL,4,A'shock tactic' to punish trade union
OL,5,Aactivity, tribunal hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt said individuals were dismissed for
OL,8,Fgross misconduct, not alleged trade
OL,9,Funion activity. Rockstar's closing
OL,10,Fspeeches are due to be heard at the
OL,11,Ftribunal in Glasgow on Wednesday, with
OL,12,Fa judgement due at a later date.
